--- !u!114 &8619747884144957933
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1680277126811690134}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 36422ed2236b4ef4d88887b861d3bdcc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  buttonText:
    fi: "J\xE4rvikaisla\n\nJ\xE4rvikaisla on lehdet\xF6n ja \npaksuvartinen kasvi,
      joka \nsekoitetaan usein \nj\xE4rviruokoon. Sen ruskeat \nkukinnot kasvavat
      pienin\xE4 \nryhmin\xE4. Se kasvaa \nj\xE4rviss\xE4 ja v\xE4h\xE4suolaisissa
      \nmurtovesiss\xE4.\n\n\nOsmank\xE4\xE4mi\n\nSuomessa kasvaa kahta \nosmank\xE4\xE4milajia:
      leve\xE4- ja \nkapeaosmank\xE4\xE4mi. Ne ovat \nkorkeita kasveja, joilla on
      \npaksut varret ja tiivis \nkukinto, ja ne kasvavat \nmatalassa vedess\xE4."
    sw: "S\xE4v\n\nS\xE4v \xE4r en bladl\xF6s och \ntjockstj\xE4lkad v\xE4xt som
      \nofta f\xF6rv\xE4xlas med \nbladvass. Dess bruna \nblomst\xE4llningar sitter
      i sm\xE5 \ngrupper. Den v\xE4xer i sj\xF6ar \noch i svagt br\xE4ckta vatten.\n\n\nKaveldun\n\nI
      Finland v\xE4xer tv\xE5 arter \nav kaveldun: bred- och \nsmalkaveldun. Det
      \xE4r h\xF6ga \nv\xE4xter med tjocka stj\xE4lkar \noch t\xE4ta blomst\xE4llningar,
      \nsom trivs i grunt vatten.\r\n"
    en: "Common club-rush\n\nCommon club-rush is a \nleafless, thick-stemmed \nplant
      that is often confused \nwith common reed. Its \nbrown inflorescences grow
      \nin small clusters. It grows in \nlakes and brackish waters.\n\n\nCattail\n\nTwo
      species of cattail \ngrow in Finland: the \nbroad-leaved cattail and \nthe
      narrow-leaved cattail. \nThey are tall plants with \nthick stems and dense
      \ninflorescences, and they \ngrow in shallow water."
