--- !u!114 &1757137428322153564
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3752300061302600148}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 36422ed2236b4ef4d88887b861d3bdcc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  buttonText:
    fi: "<align=center><b>RUOHOT</b></align>\n\nRuohokasvit auttavat vahvistamaan
      kosteikon rantoja ja est\xE4v\xE4t eroosiota. Ne tarjoavat elinymp\xE4rist\xF6j\xE4
      monille hy\xF6nteisille.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nJouhivihvil\xE4\n\nJouhivihvil\xE4ll\xE4
      on pitk\xE4 vaakasuora juurakko ja ohuita, millimetrin paksuisia varsia. Sen
      tihe\xE4 kukinto nousee usein puoliv\xE4liin vartta, ja kasvi viihtyy paljaalla
      kostealla maalla.\n"
    sw: "<align=center><b>GR\xC4SARTER</b></align>\n\nGr\xE4sarter hj\xE4lper till
      att st\xE4rka v\xE5tmarkens str\xE4nder och f\xF6rebygga erosion. De ger ocks\xE5
      livsmilj\xF6er f\xF6r m\xE5nga insekter.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTr\xE5dt\xE5g\n\nTr\xE5dt\xE5g
      har en l\xE5ng, horisontell rotstock och tunna stj\xE4lkar som \xE4r bara n\xE5gra
      millimeter tjocka. Dess t\xE4ta blomstand n\xE5r ofta upp till mitten av stj\xE4lken,
      och v\xE4xten trivs p\xE5 bar, fuktig mark."
    en: '<align=center><b>GRASSES</b></align>


      Grasses help stabilize wetland
      banks and prevent erosion. They provide habitats for many insects.











      Thread
      rush


      Thread rush has a long, horizontal rhizome and thin stems that
      are about a millimeter thick. Its dense inflorescence often rises to the middle
      of the stem, and the plant thrives in bare, moist soil.'
